n jeder Spieler seine Bibliothek nach einer beliebigen Karte durchsuchen und diese Karte auf seine Hand nehmen. Jeder Spieler, der eine Karte gesucht hat, mischt seine Bibliothek danach neu.', 'type': 'Beschwörung eines Klerikers', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec81c9ea-1075-43e7-8ebd-46c7f8afe664'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Noble benefactor', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b84128f5-c6e6-42ca-a668-74e76506ef96'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Noble bienfaiteur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f303ced-cbe7-40fc-9d9c-4db6f32e2ce0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Benefattore Nobile', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08438b68-025c-4995-b838-819fe0cb97c1'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '気前のいい後援者', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca47ad2e-a698-4e6b-a476-41f2c217f045'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Nobre Benfeitor', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c798753-4e97-4445-8edf-87a4b2f268ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Ehrenschuld', 'text': 'Regeneriere eine Kreatur Deiner Wahl. Übernimm die Kontrolle über diese Kreatur.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20940b4d-3068-44e4-94e9-7cf86d14a481'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Deuda de lealtad', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f4a9af3-faa9-4048-85cb-233df61bcc59'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Dette de loyauté', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8379da46-02ec-4323-85e4-08be5cf005f8'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Debito di Fedeltà', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '662d2b82-ead6-4ffc-bc46-b9859ae3904d'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '恩義', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'i