zahl der Karten auf Deiner Hand ist.', 'type': 'Verzaubere Kreatur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd86a703b-b6c2-4c51-a4c2-9d8c1c270685'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Armadura empírea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24accb94-31fe-4c17-9b12-27c429c9bbee'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Armure empyrée', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '184e46c3-6b9e-48f9-aa97-71aadcc47c7e'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Armatura Empirea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ee54e74-ba32-4933-b7c5-11d01cf5e4f2'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '浄火の鎧', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21868cb5-e3ea-403d-9581-c1dda48635d4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Armadura Empírea', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aff81843-cb97-43df-8386-7b8b32f76f5e'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", "[{'name': 'Hitzschlag', 'text': 'Zerstöre am Ende jedes Kampfes alle Kreaturen, die in diesem Zug geblockt haben oder geblockt wurden.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d72aee7-1ae0-47e4-b1ba-17354daf92a4'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Golpe de calor', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f3cee08-6985-4421-8d70-616208f12eb0'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Coup de chaleur', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3c748f83-7176-4281-ba52-02e35cd6e837'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Colpo di Calore', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b0c31fa-debe-48c7-b7ff-c58496cdb4ce'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': '熱射病', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cfac3bca-ea28-4a5c-b1aa-d5af065c7f0c'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Insolação', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'accf109f-5a82-41c1-afbe-5c73c3434a17'}, 'multiverseid': None}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hurloonschamanin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Hurloonschamanin aus dem Spiel auf dem Friedhof landet, bestimmt jeder Spieler ein Land, dass er kontrolliert, und begräbt es.\', \'type\': \'Beschwörung eines Minotauren\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc04d69e-6052-475c-bf53-f0eff48eedbd\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Chamán de Hurloon\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d8d11d-c3ea-4142-bc12-62fa5fb1035d\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': "Shamane de l\'Hurloon", \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db9b222c-f315-41db-9cf3-2d9c44d95c36\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano di Hurloon\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf91e40e-5c3a-41e7-9eac-745114f377a2\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'ハールーンのシャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea2f2915-c5d9-4c51-a636-3ae9ee5f6bf0\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}, {\'name\': \'Xamã de Hurloon\', \'flavor\': None, \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'216977ab-212e-4388-b7f8-0b061968753c\'}, \'multiverseid\': None}]', "[{'name': 'Händler des Meervolks', 'text': 'Wenn die Händler des Meervolks ins Spiel kommen, ziehe eine Karte. Wähle danach eine Karte aus Deiner Hand und wirf diese ab.', 'type': 'Beschwörung von Meervolk', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6d33cb4-649c-4a44-a79f-693319081c93'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Mercaderes tritones', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '696a1c31-661a-4edd-b2c4-3aa84c8d7624'}, 'multiverseid': None}, {'name': 'Marchands ondins', 'flavor': None, 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '