original_text: ['All creatures you control are unaffected by summoning sickness.', 'All damage dealt to creatures is reduced to 0.', 'Any player may pay o2 during his or her draw phase to draw a card. Players may use this ability as many times as they choose.', 'Artifact and enchantment spells cost target opponent an additional o2 to play.\\nSacrifice Aura of Silence: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'At the end of each combat, destroy all creatures that blocked or were blocked this turn.', 'Attacking does not cause Ardent Militia to tap.', 'Attacking does not cause creatures you control to tap.', 'Banding', 'Banding\\nCumulative upkeep o1', 'Bloodrock Cyclops attacks each turn if able.', 'Bury target creature that was damaged this turn.', 'Choose and discard X cards: Firestorm deals X damage to each of X target creatures and/or players.', 'Choose three target creatures and/or players. Cone of Flame deals 1 damage to the first, 2 damage to the second, and 3 damage to the third.', 'Counter target instant, interrupt, or sorcery spell unless its caster pays an additional o1.\\nDraw a card.', 'Creatures cannot be the target of spells.', "Cumulative upkeep o1\\nAt the end of your upkeep, bury each creature with casting cost equal to Wave of Terror's last paid cumulative upkeep.", "Cumulative upkeep o1\\nIf Revered Unicorn leaves play, its controller gains life equal to Revered Unicorn's last paid cumulative upkeep.", 'Cumulative upkeep o1\\nWhen Ancestral Knowledge comes into play, look at the top ten cards of your library, then remove any number of them from the game and put the rest back on top of your library in any order.\\nIf Ancestral Knowledge leaves play, shuffle your library.', "Cumulative upkeep o2\\nIf Heart of Bogardan's cumulative upkeep cost is not paid, Heart of Bogardan deals damage equal to its last paid cumulative upkeep to target player and each creature he or she controls.", 'Cumulative upkeep o2\\nMwonvuli Ooze has power and toughness each equal to 1 plus its last paid cumulative upkeep.', 'Cumulative upkeep o2\\nWhen Arctic Wolves comes into play, draw a card.', 'Cumulative upkeep o\\nG', 'Cumulative upkeep—2 life\\nAll damage dealt to creatures you control is reduced to 0.', 'Cumulative upkeep—\\nDraw a card\\nAt the end of each of your turns, sacrifice a land and discard your hand.', 'Cumulative upkeep—\\nPut a -1/-1 counter on Aboroth', "During each player's upkeep, if that player controls any nonblack permanents other than lands, Urborg Stalker deals 1 damage to that player.", 'During your upkeep, Cinder Giant deals 2 damage to each other creature you control.', 'During your upkeep, Festering Evil deals 1 damage to each creature and player.\\no\\nBo\\nB, Sacrifice Festering Evil: Festering Evil deals 3 damage to each creature and player.', 'During your upkeep, bury all artifacts and enchantments.', 'During your upkeep, pay o1o\\nW or bury Peacekeeper.\\nCreatures cannot attack.', 'During your upkeep, put the top seven cards of your library into your graveyard.', 'During your upkeep, remove the top creature card in your graveyard from the game or bury Barrow Ghoul.', 'During your upkeep, you may choose to flip a coin. Target opponent calls heads or tails while the coin is in the air. If the flip ends up in your favor, put a fuse counter on Goblin Bomb. Otherwise, remove a fuse counter from Goblin Bomb.\\nRemove 5 fuse counters from Goblin Bomb, Sacrifice Goblin Bomb: Goblin Bomb deals 20 damage to target player.', 'Each creature gains "During your upkeep, pay o1 or bury this creature."', 'Each creature you control cannot be blocked by more than one creature.', "Each player chooses a creature with the highest total casting cost he or she controls, then pays an amount of mana equal to that creature's total casting cost or buries the creature.", 'Each player chooses and discards any number of cards, then draws that many cards.\\nDraw a card.', 'Each player draws a number of cards equal to the number of creature cards in his or her graveyard.', 'Enchanted creature cannot be blocked by creatures with power 3 or greater.\\nSacrifice Kithkin Armor: Prevent all damage to enchanted creature from one source.', "Enchanted creature does not untap during its controller's untap phase.\\nDuring the upkeep of enchanted creature's controller, that player may discard a card at random to untap that creature.", 'Enchanted creature gains "Cumulative upkeep o1."', "Enchanted creature gains flying.\\nSacrifice Phantom Wings: Return enchanted creature to owner's hand.", 'Enchanted creature gets +1/+1.\\nSacrifice Briar Shield: Enchanted creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Enchanted creature gets +1/-1.\\nSacrifice Coils of the Medusa: Destroy all non-Wall creatures blocking enchanted creature.', 'Enchanted creature gets +X/+X, where X is equal to the number of cards in your hand.', 'First strike\\nYou may play Benalish Knight whenever you could play an instant.', 'First strike\\no1oo\\nW Tap target creature blocking Master of Arms.', 'Flanking (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', 'Flip a coin; target opponent calls heads or tails while coin is in the air. If the flip ends up in your favor, double the damage dealt by a source you control. Otherwise, prevent all damage from that source.', 'Flying, phasing', 'Flying, protection from black', 'Flying\\nCloud Djinn can block only creatures with flying.', 'Flying\\nCumulative upkeep—1 life', 'Flying\\nDuring your upkeep, Fledgling Djinn deals 1 damage to you.', 'Flying\\nDuring your upkeep, remove the top creature card in your graveyard from the game or bury Circling Vultures.\\nIf Circling Vultures is in your hand, you may discard it. Play this ability as an instant.', "Flying\\nIf Alabaster Dragon is put into any graveyard from play, shuffle Alabaster Dragon into its owner's library.", 'Flying\\nIf Fog Elemental attacks or blocks, bury it at end of combat.', 'Flying\\nIf Mistmoon Griffin is put into any graveyard from play, remove Mistmoon Griffin from the game, then put the top creature card from your graveyard into play.', "Flying\\nIf any other creature comes into play, return Timid Drake to owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nPay 1 life: Regenerate', 'Flying\\nSkip your next untap phase: Avizoa gets +2/+2 until end of turn. Use this ability only once each turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sage Owl comes into play, look at the top four cards of your library and put them back in any order.', 'For each card in your hand, gain 2 life.', 'Foriysian Brigade may block two creatures each combat. (All blocking assignments must still be legal.)', 'Gain life equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', 'If Abyssal Gatekeeper is put into any graveyard from play, each player chooses and buries a creature he or she controls.', 'If Barishi is put into any graveyard from play, remove Barishi from the game, then shuffle all creature cards from your graveyard into your library.', 'If Bogardan Firefiend is put into any graveyard from play, it deals 2 damage to target creature.', 'If Cinder Wall blocks, destroy it at end of combat.', 'If Dwarven Berserker is blocked, it gets +3/+0 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'If Hurloon Shaman is put into any graveyard from play, each player chooses and buries a land he or she controls.', 'If Jangling Automaton attacks, untap all creatures defending player controls.', 'If Liege of the Hollows is put into any graveyard from play, each player may pay any amount of mana to put that number of Squirrel tokens into play under his or her control. Treat those tokens as 1/1 green creatures.', 'If Noble Benefactor is put into any graveyard from play, each player may search his or her library for any one card and put that card into his or her hand. Each player who searches his or her library shuffles it afterwards.', 'If Sawtooth Ogre blocks or is blocked by any creature, Sawtooth Ogre deals 1 damage to that creature at end of combat.', 'If Sylvan Hierophant is put into any graveyard from play, remove Sylvan Hierophant from the game, then return a creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'If Veteran Explorer is put into any graveyard from play, each player may search his or her library for up to two basic land cards and put those lands into play. Each player shuffles his or her library afterwards.', 'If any creatures are put into your graveyard from play, you may bury Angelic Renewal and put one of those creatures into play.', 'If any opponent successfully casts a summon or artifact creature spell, bury Straw Golem.', 'Islandhome (If defending player controls no islands, this creature cannot attack. If you control no islands, bury this creature.)\\nManta Ray cannot be blocked except by blue creatures.', 'Lava Hounds is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\nWhen Lava Hounds comes into play, it deals 4 damage to you.', 'Lava Storm deals 2 damage to each attacking creature or 2 damage to each blocking creature.', "Look at target player's hand. Choose two of those cards and put them on top of his or her library in any order.", 'Maraxus of Keld has power and toughness each equal to the total number of untapped artifacts, creatures, and lands you control.', 'Pay half your life, rounded up: Put your graveyard on top of your library, then remove all but five cards of your library from the game. Put the rest on top of your library in any order.', 'Phantom Warrior is unblockable.', "Phasing\\nIf Ertai's Familiar leaves play, put the top three cards of your library into your graveyard.\\noo\\nU Ertai's Familiar cannot phase out until the beginning of your next upkeep.", 'Play only on a creature you control.\\nTap enchanted creature: Enchanted creature deals 1 damage to target creature or player.\\nSacrifice Fire Whip: Fire Whip deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Play only when blockers are declared.\\nX target attacking creatures are considered blocked. Choking Vines deals 1 damage to each of those creatures.', 'Players cannot play any artifact abilities requiring an activation cost.', 'Razortooth Rats cannot be blocked except by artifact creatures and black creatures.', 'Regenerate target creature. Gain control of that creature.', 'Remove X creature cards in your graveyard from the game: Haunting Misery deals X damage to target player.', 'Remove all cards in your library from the game. Shuffle your graveyard into your library.', 'Remove the top creature card in your graveyard from the game: +2/+2 until end of turn', 'Remove the top creature card in your graveyard from the game: Regenerate', 'Return X target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand and lose X life.', 'Return target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Return target instant, interrupt, or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Sacrifice Goblin Grenadiers: Destroy target creature and target land. Use this ability only if Goblin Grenadiers is attacking and unblocked.', 'Sacrifice a blue permanent: Counter target spell.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Target opponent chooses and discards two cards.', 'Sacrifice an untapped creature: Enchanted creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.\\nSacrifice enchanted creature: All creatures you control get +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Search your library for up to three creature cards and put them into your graveyard. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'Swampwalk\\nIf Odylic Wraith damages any player, that player chooses and discards a card.', 'Tap a creature you control: +1/+1 until end of turn', 'Target creature attacks this turn if able.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target opponent chooses and buries a number of creatures he or she controls equal to the number of creatures put into your graveyard from play so far this turn.', "Target player shuffles up to three target cards from his or her graveyard into his or her library.\\nDraw a card.\\nIf Gaea's Blessing is put into your graveyard from your library, shuffle your graveyard into your library.", 'Thunderbolt deals 3 damage to target player or 4 damage to target creature with flying.', 'Thundermare is unaffected by summoning sickness.\\nWhen Thundermare comes into play, tap all other creatures.', 'Trample\\nCumulative upkeep—1 life', 'Untap all creatures you control.', "When Abduction comes into play, untap enchanted creature.\\nGain control of enchanted creature.\\nIf enchanted creature is put into any graveyard, put that creature into play under its owner's control.", 'When Fallow Wurm comes into play, choose and discard a land card or bury Fallow Wurm.', 'When Gemstone Mine comes into play, put three mining counters on it.\\noc\\nT, Remove a mining counter from Gemstone Mine: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. If there are no mining counters on Gemstone Mine, bury it.', 'When Harvest Wurm comes into play, return any basic land card from your graveyard to your hand or bury Harvest Wurm.', 'When Hidden Horror comes into play, choose and discard a creature card or bury Hidden Horror.', 'When Llanowar Sentinel comes into play, you may pay o1o\\nG to search your library for a Llanowar Sentinel card. Put that card into play. Shuffle your library afterwards.', 'When Lotus Vale comes into play, sacrifice two untapped lands or bury Lotus Vale.\\noc\\nT: Add three mana of any one color to your mana pool.', 'When Merfolk Traders comes into play, draw a card, then choose and discard a card.', 'When Roc Hatchling comes into play, put four shell counters on it.\\nDuring your upkeep, remove a shell counter from Roc Hatchling.\\nAs long as Roc Hatchling has no shell counters on it, it gets +3/+2 and gains flying.', 'When Rogue Elephant comes into play, sacrifice a forest or bury Rogue Elephant.', 'When Scorched Ruins comes into play, sacrifice two untapped lands or bury Scorched Ruins.\\noc\\nT: Add four colorless mana to your mana pool.', 'When Striped Bears comes into play, draw a card.', 'Whenever Tolarian Entrancer is blocked by any creature, gain control of that creature at end of combat.', "Whenever a creature is put into any graveyard from play, Dingus Staff deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Whenever any creature comes into play, Æther Flash deals 2 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever any creature you control attacks, it phases out at end of combat.', 'Whenever any land target opponent controls is tapped for mana, tap all lands he or she controls that can produce any type of mana that land can produce.', 'You cannot play summon or artifact creature spells.', "You may remove the top three black cards in your graveyard from the game instead of paying Spinning Darkness's casting cost. Spinning Darkness deals 3 damage to target nonblack creature. Gain 3 life.", 'o0: Draw a card. Ophidian deals no combat damage this turn. Use this ability only if Ophidian is attacking and unblocked and only once each turn.', "o0: Put the top creature card of defending player's graveyard into play under your control. Bone Dancer deals no combat damage this turn. Use this ability only if Bone Dancer is attacking and unblocked and only once each turn.", 'o1, Remove the top card in your graveyard from the game: Enchanted creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'o1, Remove the top card in your graveyard from the game: Prevent 1 damage to any creature.', 'o1, oc\\nT: Target creature gains flanking until end of turn. (Whenever a creature without flanking is assigned to block this creature, the blocking creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.)', 'o1o\\nGoo\\nG Destroy all other enchantments.', 'o1o\\nW, oc\\nT: Target blocked creature deals no combat damage this turn.', 'o2, Sacrifice a card in play: Draw a card.', 'o2: Until end of turn, Chimeric Sphere is a 2/1 artifact creature with flying.\\no2: Until end of turn, Chimeric Sphere is a 3/2 artifact creature without flying.', 'o2: Until end of turn, target nonartifact creature gets +1/+0 and is an artifact creature.', 'o2o\\nGoo\\nG Reveal the top card of your library to all players. If that card is a creature card, put it into play. Otherwise, bury it.', 'o3, oc\\nT: Until end of turn, if at any time the top card in your graveyard is an instant, interrupt, or sorcery card, you may play that card as though it were in your hand. If you do so, remove the card from the game.', "o5, oc\\nT: Reveal the top three cards of your library to target opponent. Bury one of those cards of that opponent's choice. Draw the remaining cards.", 'o5: Until end of turn, Xanthic Statue is an 8/8 artifact creature with trample.', 'o\\nBo\\nB, Pay 2 life, Sacrifice a swamp: Put target creature card from your graveyard into play.', 'o\\nG, Sacrifice a forest: Put a +2/+2 counter on Fungus Elemental. Use this ability only if Fungus Elemental came into play this turn.', 'o\\nUo\\nU, oc\\nT: Target creature phases out.', 'o\\nW, Remove a creature card in your graveyard from the game: Gain 1 life.', 'o\\nWo\\nW, oc\\nT: Destroy target red permanent.', 'o\\nXo\\nXo\\nR, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Orcish Settlers: Destroy X target lands.', 'oc\\nT, Sacrifice Llanowar Druid: Untap all forests.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool. Play this ability as a mana source.\\no1, oc\\nT, Sacrifice Mind Stone: Draw a card.', 'oc\\nT: Add one colorless mana to your mana pool.\\no2, oc\\nT: Until end of turn, you may play creature cards whenever you could play instants.', 'oc\\nT: Heavy Ballista deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'oc\\nT: Put a -1/-1 counter on Serrated Biskelion and a -1/-1 counter on target creature.', "oc\\nT: Remove the bottom card of target player's graveyard from the game.\\no1, Sacrifice Phyrexian Furnace: Remove target card in any graveyard from the game and draw a card.", "oc\\nT: Switch power and toughness of target creature until end of turn. Effects that alter that creature's power alter its toughness instead, and vice versa, until end of turn.", 'oc\\nT: Tap target artifact you do not control.', 'oo\\nG Target creature loses flying until end of turn.\\nSacrifice Downdraft: Downdraft deals 2 damage to each creature with flying.', 'oo\\nR Destroy target artifact defending player controls. Goblin Vandal deals no combat damage this turn. Use this ability only if Goblin Vandal is attacking and unblocked and only once each turn.']
